{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01252",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.56,
      "end_seconds": 4.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.75,
      "end_seconds": 9.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.52,
      "end_seconds": 17.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Honestly, it's burning when I pass urine, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.21,
      "end_seconds": 22.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.16,
      "end_seconds": 37.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.79,
      "end_seconds": 58.13,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.7, pressure 118 over 76. And oxygen saturation is 98 percent, heart rate 78. What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.57,
      "end_seconds": 62.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Yesterday, it came on out of nowhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.76,
      "end_seconds": 66.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Right, is it constant or in episodes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.37,
      "end_seconds": 78.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "I'd say on and off. Oh, and a dull ache low in my tummy. That's been about the same, four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.88,
      "end_seconds": 85.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Have you had burning when you pass urine before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.75,
      "end_seconds": 93.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.22,
      "end_seconds": 110.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Any vaginal discharge, blood in the urine, fever or back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.0,
      "end_seconds": 118.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "No, no vaginal discharge, blood in the urine, fever or back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.94,
      "end_seconds": 124.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.91,
      "end_seconds": 127.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.93,
      "end_seconds": 134.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "So, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.29,
      "end_seconds": 140.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.0,
      "end_seconds": 155.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.97,
      "end_seconds": 172.18,
      "duration_seconds": 15.21,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I look after my grandchildren most days. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.04,
      "end_seconds": 176.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.45,
      "end_seconds": 183.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Low haemoglobin, for two years. I've had heart disease, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.67,
      "end_seconds": 194.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Right, so low haemoglobin is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.58,
      "end_seconds": 207.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.34,
      "end_seconds": 211.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Just a triple bypass, eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.15,
      "end_seconds": 215.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.35,
      "end_seconds": 221.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Metoprolol. I take it 50 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.05,
      "end_seconds": 224.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.45,
      "end_seconds": 227.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "For about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.24,
      "end_seconds": 234.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.62,
      "end_seconds": 239.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.24,
      "end_seconds": 243.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.7,
      "end_seconds": 263.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with slight tenderness just above the pubic bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.93,
      "end_seconds": 293.4,
      "duration_seconds": 26.47,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Taking everything into account, it's hard to say. An uncomplicated urinary infection is one possibility and vaginal irritation another, and I'd rather not commit yet. Let's book a urine dipstick to look into burning urine. I'm prescribing nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, three days. That should help with urinary infection. Drink plenty of water and avoid holding urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.94,
      "end_seconds": 310.2,
      "duration_seconds": 15.26,
      "text": "Please don't wait if you get a fever or back pain. That's when to be seen urgently. Let's plan a check if it is not better in three days. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.92,
      "end_seconds": 314.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}